      "sourceTextSha256": "c1c041b3e7bc43d4f1c748ee56096db171eb0b8efd03c2cc79c0c93b77cc620f",
      "text": "Day 4 · Breakfast, then a full-day excursion to the Atacama Salt Flat, the Altiplanic Lagoons and Socaire. Visit the high lagoons of Miscanti and Miñiques, then enjoy a gourmet lunch prepared by our chef amid the out-of-this-world landscape. Continue to the Chaxa Lagoon in the Los Flamencos National Reserve, home to three of the world’s six flamingo species, and to Toconao, with the San Lucas church and its bell tower. Return to San Pedro.",
